          "kind": "text",
          "text": "At t=0 and \u03bc=0.5 the Hamiltonian is a sum of independent onsite terms. The ground state has one boson per site. Removing one boson costs 0.5; for nmax\u22652, adding a second boson also costs 0.5. Therefore \u0394bulk=0.5, \u03c1\u2080=1, F\u2080=0, and K\u2080=0."
